<title>FINLAND: LONGER HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>LONGER HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Longer Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was steady at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			 January 24 fix	January 23 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.07 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.14 pct		3.12 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.21 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.31 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
